  "q": "“When the zombie apocalypse happens, you'll be glad you bought a flamethrower. Works against hordes of the undead or your money back!”",
  "zh": "丧尸末日来临时，你会庆幸自己买了火焰喷射器。对不死军团有效，无效退款！",
  "bg": "To fund the first Boring Company test tunnel in Los Angeles, his team sold “Not-a-Flamethrower” units at $500 each — merchandise as financing. The internet was unsure whether it was a joke; he made it a sales campaign.",
